title: 'conference hold false-positive: browser main-process cmdline retains zoom.us/j/ join URL from launch forever (until browser restart), so hold_during_conference holds ALL TTS with chime-only beeps long after the meeting ended. Seen 2026-08-10: Brave launched 1d11h earlier with join URL; stale zoom client also lingered. Suggest: ignore boot-time argv URLs (age-gate cmdline matches), require live AV stream from the matched process, and/or cap via conference_max_hold_s with audible/logged hint. Also: hark doctor should surface ''conference hold ACTIVE (matched: ...)'' so operators see why TTS is silent.'
